{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日3期生のライブを観に行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな頑張ってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの想いや必死さ、\n初々しさが沢山伝わってきました◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私も頑張ろうって感化されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒のステージに立てるのが楽しみです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/11/1098111/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな葉月ちゃん。\nおまんじゅうちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯いっぱい食べる姿も\n目合わせて笑ってくれる姿も\n可愛いんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹と同い年だから余計に妹みたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/11/1098111/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楓ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に楓ちゃんの顔好き。\n可愛いな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子大生コンビだね◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のみんなとも沢山写真撮りたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつ会えるかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/11/1098111/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りの公演も頑張ってね◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}